            <profile id="07e2-8faf-bfe4-a7c1" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="aab0-aa1e-0319-4ffe" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword, thrusting spear and shield. May have light armour (+2 pts) or heavy armour (+3 pts), large shield (+1 pt). May have throwing spear (free) instead of thrusting spear. Phalanx. If all citizens are equipped without armour and have throwing spears, they may be fielded as Light Infantry but may then not use the Phalanx rule. (Armies of Antiquity p.23)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="0f32-b9e9-3a41-dc3e" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
